msgctxt "Item:26539:0:8"
msgid "A detailed record of one adventurer's continuing path to becoming a realm-renowned monk─so detailed, in fact, that all who read it come to swear they experienced the events firsthand.<br><br>Use to instantly level monk to 70 and complete all job quests up through “The Power to Protect.” Cannot be used outside large settlements. Automatic logout will commence upon usage."
