#. ja: アム・アレーンに棲息する脂質豊富な砂海魚<br>[魚拓額縁G3に設定可能]
#. de: Dieser an Land lebende Anglerfisch nennt die Sande Amh Araengs sein Zuhause. Feinschmecker schätzen seine besonders reichhaltige Leber. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe L ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Ce poisson des sables vit dans les régions désertiques d'Amh Araeng, et possède une grande valeur nutritive.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de grande taille]
#. column 0: Amber monkfish
#. column 2: Amber monkfish
#. column 9: Amber Monkfish
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:26749:0:8"
msgid "Fish can adapt to the most unlikely of environments, as this repulsive sand-dweller amply proves. It spends most of its adult life burrowing through the sands of Amh Araeng searching for moisture and snaring unsuspecting prey in its fearsome jaws.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]"
msgstr "Рыбы могут приспособиться к самым неожиданным условиям, и этот жуткий обитатель песков — тому доказательство. Большую часть взрослой жизни он роется в песках Ам-Аранга в поисках влаги, подстерегая добычу в своей ужасной пасти.<br><br>[Можно повесить в рамке большого размера.]"

#. ja: アンバーモンクフィッシュ
#. de: Bernsteinangler
#. fr: Baudroie des sables
#. column 0: Amber monkfish
#. column 2: Amber monkfish
#. column 8: Fish can adapt to the most unlikely of environments, as this repulsive sand-dweller amply proves. It spends most of its adult life burrowing through the sands of Amh Araeng searching for moisture and snaring unsuspecting prey in its fearsome jaws.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
msgctxt "Item:26749:0:9"
msgid "Amber Monkfish"
msgstr "Песчаный морской чёрт"

#. ja: キャラコトラウト
#. de: Tüpfelforelle
#. fr: omble calico
#. column 2: calico trout
#. column 8: The beautiful markings and coloration of this elusive species are known to cause pangs of guilt in those who catch one, shortly before they bash it over the head and gut it.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
#. column 9: Calico Trout
msgctxt "Item:26750:0:0"
msgid "calico trout"
msgstr "пёстрая форель"

